{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:17 2026-05-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:17 2026-05-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:17 2026-05-06 HKT</p><img alt=\"「加州勇勝」轉泥開勝門\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/3960352e70c7765f208d163c0236ab4e/2026-05/r5_1.jpg\"/><p>今晚第五場四班泥地千二米，告東尼以「加州勇勝」勝出，馬兒打開在港勝門，賽後他的兒子告承澤(Sean)、女兒告津瑜(Antonia)及女婿George都有一起拉頭馬，分享喜悅。</p><p>「加州勇勝」馬主梁君宇說：「『加州勇勝』較早前在泥地試閘走勢不錯，因此練馬師告東尼部署馬兒嘗試今場初跑泥地，結果試出彩虹，我相信此馬跑草地和泥地皆合，希望馬兒日後可以繼續交出好成績。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/adb8a2459fcbc75c39a7b8372c21f7f8/2026-05/3ac5eed4-c3a4-446c-aba6-6124d50b3340.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/82e50f80baa4813061d7eecaef1727d9/2026-05/12e48844-8d55-4cc4-ae5b-4e0ad9206fce.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/001661f96c668a09ec3e03f2f3c22270/2026-05/14ae50a9-5b63-4929-9f99-4ee793bcfbcf.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b0cfaeaeb9a75a5052fd7fb36c0c0026/2026-05/96e07cf0-f4b8-454a-83d7-0f710fb32103.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c7966beaf26cb6e3d4296c2d36fe2712/2026-05/312a9fa3-341b-4e87-b8a0-2969e5c904e0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3a8e588eb9d3585ff113671946421609/2026-05/47496b83-77dd-4a2a-9df3-a3a14fbe91cd.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/112572f7bf48cc4d82c6d2380d2e66c2/2026-05/81149f3e-2c36-48a6-ae73-c36610dab8f2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/46e48377f3e37cf56267a5ef71d1115d/2026-05/b8cfe6da-045b-4ac2-b112-75fd4baa0491.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/178460201287035440fcef79055248ba/2026-05/cc3b7ffa-9478-4caa-8557-4098cc8d03d4.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d18ff58098904219bca04d14089cfef/2026-05/d194cbc6-01b9-4dd0-9d23-928f087c11e0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f486f3b3f02fe4b3df7bcdc17868dc9e/2026-05/e8599f26-9a82-48f9-aa4c-23fe81c970b7